00:59:07.440 --> 00:59:13.520
the application had a pretty extensive set of drawings with it to build a nice kennel and all that stuff

00:59:14.000 --> 00:59:14.800
and

00:59:14.960 --> 00:59:16.400
after he got approval,

00:59:18.000 --> 00:59:19.520
one, he didn't file

00:59:20.560 --> 00:59:24.025
the final documents with the town hall, town clerk,

00:59:24.825 --> 00:59:29.145
and then he didn't build the kennel that was authorized in there.

00:59:30.985 --> 00:59:32.025
Either of those

00:59:32.425 --> 00:59:34.505
would have invalidated

00:59:34.090 --> 00:59:37.850
the special permit. So that's how we got to the point where

00:59:38.090 --> 00:59:40.890
it was not a modification of a special permit.

00:59:41.290 --> 00:59:48.475
There was no special permit to modify because he didn't file it, then he didn't comply with it. And so that

00:59:49.515 --> 00:59:52.795
took us a while to get through the facts of

00:59:53.035 --> 00:59:55.835
we were essentially starting over with a new permit there.

00:59:57.435 --> 01:00:02.715
I think there might be some confusion too, I just wanted to mention it, that when we use a special permit,

01:00:03.970 --> 01:00:06.530
there might be some thought that

01:00:07.330 --> 01:00:12.450
the regulations don't apply because we're bringing it to the Commission. The Commission can do whatever they want.

01:00:13.650 --> 01:00:15.730
And that's not true either. The

01:00:16.770 --> 01:00:17.890
special permit

01:00:18.525 --> 01:00:19.325
really,

01:00:19.645 --> 01:00:24.525
you know, the significance of that is that buys us into holding a public hearing to get

01:00:24.925 --> 01:00:27.725
more information from the public on

01:00:27.965 --> 01:00:28.925
the permit.

01:00:29.165 --> 01:00:29.965
It doesn't

01:00:30.445 --> 01:00:41.170
allow us to not comply with any of the regulations or any of that kind of stuff. So we have to comply with all the regulations, but we also have to hold a public hearing and that's

01:00:41.170 --> 01:00:43.490
a significance of the special permit piece of it.

01:00:46.075 --> 01:00:55.355
So anyhow, I'm a lot clearer on that now. That might not be absolutely clear to all of you guys, but we'll keep talking about it each time we go through one of those and

01:00:55.755 --> 01:00:57.035
make sure that

01:00:58.430 --> 01:01:05.710
we understand that whatever we do is rooted in the regulations and that we are doing our very best to comply with those.

